Aholo3D for Rhino
Copyright 2026 CuriousArc / qrost

Independent community integration for Aholo3D World and RenderCloud.
Not an official Manycore, Aholo3D, or McNeel product.

Contains adapted code from Lux3D for Rhino (Apache-2.0), maintained by qrost:
https://github.com/QROST/lux3D-rhino
Reference source snapshot: 175d99b (2026-11-01).
Adaptations include private pipe communication, runtime discovery,
macOS Keychain/Windows DPAPI credential storage, and public-network transport.
Product identities, namespaces and state paths have been changed for Aholo3D.

The public-network transport originated in Tripo-Rhino (Apache-2.0):
https://github.com/QROST/tripo-rhino
Reference commit: 838fbd8; maintainer: qrost.

Official API specification snapshots are unmodified reference material from
https://labs.aholo.ai/api-docs/ . Their sources and capture hashes are recorded
in the source repository at docs/api/README.md; no ownership of the service or its marks is implied.

Gaussian projection, real spherical harmonics and reference alpha compositing are independently implemented from mathematical definitions. Gaussian fixtures and the alpha texture are synthetic assets created for this project. No Graphdeco training or CUDA implementation is included.

GLB container validation, private import snapshots, diagnostics and native
mesh import/repair/block wrapping were adapted from Lux3D for Rhino,
Apache-2.0, source commit 29a73abbdd50587036930ba6c45436dcd6da2ea9.
The original Tripo-Rhino attribution above also applies to these components.
Aholo3D task identities and document markers remain independent.

GS format readers, cache/display policies, USD runtime support and their
synthetic regression fixtures were adapted from
GSRhino, Apache-2.0, source commit dc90e5d. SPZ decoding follows the MIT-licensed
Niantic Labs / Adobe reference; required attribution is retained in
src/Aholo3D.Core/SpzReader.cs and docs/licenses/SPZ.txt. ZstdSharp.Port 0.8.8
is redistributed under MIT; see docs/licenses/ZstdSharp.txt.

System.IO.Packaging 8.0.1 is redistributed under MIT for OPC URI resolution;
see docs/licenses/System.IO.Packaging.txt. Copyright .NET Foundation and Contributors.
